Host back on camera; smiling, pointing forward.
"...which is how you easily stop hackers from slipping right past..."
Seamless Loop Setup: Flows directly into opening hook.

3. UI Safe Zone & Captions Guide
Safe Center: Keep all primary text overlays, faces, and graphics inside the middle 60% vertical safe box.
Danger Zones: Keep text clear of the right 15% (Like, Comment, Share buttons) and the bottom 20% (Channel handle, sound title, native captions bar).
Caption Style: 2-4 words per line, bold, centered, synchronized to spoken cadence.
4. B-Roll & Sound FX (SFX) Cues
Key SFX suggestions (e.g., subtle whoosh on topic cut, glitch sound on error highlight, click on toggle).
Free/accessible stock footage or screen capture prompts to keep retention high without expensive production.
